WEBVTT

NOTE
English captions checked against the supplied narration and on-screen wording.
NILKEEPr is the branded spelling of the spoken name "NILKeeper".

00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:03.700
Athletic director, imagine this happens
at your school today.

00:00:03.960 --> 00:00:06.900
A sixteen-year-old student,
not a five-star recruit,

00:00:07.020 --> 00:00:08.950
just a kid who's good at social media,

00:00:09.180 --> 00:00:12.950
gets offered seven hundred dollars
by a local business for a few posts.

00:00:13.260 --> 00:00:16.450
They take the money, make the posts,
and everyone moves on.

00:00:16.780 --> 00:00:20.650
Two years later, that student is preparing
to become a college athlete.

00:00:20.880 --> 00:00:23.250
Now, their name, image, and likeness,

00:00:23.340 --> 00:00:25.850
or NIL history, can matter.

00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:29.800
Under current NCAA rules,
qualifying incoming prospects

00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:32.950
have NIL disclosure
and documentation requirements.

00:00:33.260 --> 00:00:35.300
Suddenly, somebody needs answers.

00:00:35.540 --> 00:00:37.550
Who paid them? Where's the agreement?

00:00:37.780 --> 00:00:40.650
What did they agree to?
What rights did they give away?

00:00:40.880 --> 00:00:43.150
And can anyone produce the documentation?

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:45.450
That's the hidden NIL problem.

00:00:45.760 --> 00:00:48.200
Students can begin creating an NIL history

00:00:48.340 --> 00:00:51.650
years before anyone knows
they're going to become college athletes.

00:00:51.880 --> 00:00:54.200
But there's another question
schools need to consider.

00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:58.450
What happens when it's the parent
or their attorney asking those questions?

00:00:58.740 --> 00:01:02.200
If a student suffers financial harm,
an eligibility issue,

00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:05.800
unauthorized use of their NIL,
or a contract dispute,

00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:08.400
the school may have to explain
what policies,

00:01:08.560 --> 00:01:11.900
education, records, and safeguards
it had in place.

00:01:12.160 --> 00:01:15.900
Whether that creates legal liability
depends on the facts and applicable law.

00:01:16.300 --> 00:01:19.000
But having no documented system
can leave the school

00:01:19.040 --> 00:01:22.280
in a much more difficult position
when responding to a complaint,

00:01:22.620 --> 00:01:24.300
investigation, or claim.

00:01:24.600 --> 00:01:27.600
So ask yourself, could your school
demonstrate today

00:01:27.760 --> 00:01:30.750
what it did to educate
and protect its student-athletes?

00:01:31.100 --> 00:01:33.350
That's why NILKEEPr exists.

00:01:33.580 --> 00:01:35.400
The software does the heavy lifting.

00:01:35.720 --> 00:01:39.540
NILKEEPr helps track, monitor,
document, and report

00:01:39.620 --> 00:01:42.300
NIL activity in one centralized system

00:01:42.580 --> 00:01:45.450
without requiring your school
to build an NIL department

00:01:45.680 --> 00:01:48.200
or add staff simply to manage the process.

00:01:48.480 --> 00:01:50.600
We start the NIL record in high school,

00:01:50.840 --> 00:01:54.380
giving your athletic department visibility
and families a documented

00:01:54.420 --> 00:01:56.600
history before college comes calling.

00:01:56.820 --> 00:01:59.580
Don't wait until you're answering
these questions across the table

00:01:59.600 --> 00:02:01.150
from a parent or an attorney.

00:02:01.420 --> 00:02:05.100
Contact NILKEEPr today
